  description: "Model                          : CJPB10-15H6\r\nType                           
    : Single-Acting Ejection Cylinder\r\nBore Diameter            : \xD810 mm\r\nStroke                        
    : 15 mm\r\nSolenoid Valve           : 3/2 Way Monostable\nPLC Output Address 
    : 100.03\r\nPLC Signal (Extend)   : D+\r\nPLC Signal (Retract)  : D- (spring
    return / de-energise)\r\n\nEjects incorrectly oriented bodies onto the rejection
    ramp, clearing the station for the next body. Also used to clear the assembly
    position after a completed turning mechanism assembly cycle."
